      "name": "@local/firmware-finder",
      "title": {
        "en": "Firmware Finder",
        "zh": "固件检索"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Type /firmware to find production firmware by model/OS/customer in the Teambition release board and alist /PROD, inspect Teambition version-task subtasks as solved/pending, and check whether a bug landed in the customer release via commit logs. Lazy per-model retrieval by default; full index on demand.",
        "zh": "输入 /firmware 触发：按机型/系统/客户在 Teambition 发版看板和 alist /PROD 定位量产固件（线刷/OTA 直链）；查 TB 版本任务/子任务的已解决/待解决状态；用 commit-logs 判断 bug 是否修进客户正式版。默认按型号懒加载，需要全量历史时再 /firmware sync。"
      },
      "icon": "icon.svg",
      "author": "Alone-show",
      "homepage": "https://github.com/Alone-show/firmware-finder",
